 544:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   * @brief  Register a User SCI Callback
 545:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   *         To be used instead of the weak predefined callback
 546:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   * @param  hsci SCI handle
 547:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   * @param  CallbackID ID of the callback to be registered
 548:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   *         This parameter can be one of the following values:
 549:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   *           @arg @ref HAL_SCI_TX_BLOCKCOMPLETE_CB_ID Tx Block Complete Callback ID
 550:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   *           @arg @ref HAL_SCI_TX_HALFBLOCKCOMPLETE_CB_ID Tx Half Block Complete Callback ID
 551:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   *           @arg @ref HAL_SCI_TX_SRCCOMPLETE_CB_ID Tx Source Complete Callback ID
