1322:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c **** /**
1323:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   * @brief Receive an amount of data in DMA mode.
