1325:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   *         the parity bit (MSB position).
1326:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   * @note   The SCI DMA transmit channel must be configured in order to generate the clock for the 
1327:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   * @note   When SCI parity is not enabled (PCE = 0), and Word Length is configured to 9 bits (M1-M
