1355:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****     /* In case of 9bits/No Parity transfer, pData buffer provided as input parameter
1356:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****        should be aligned on a u16 frontier, as data copy from RDR will be
