2573:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c **** /**
2574:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   * @brief  Enable the SCI receiver timeout feature.
2575:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   * @param  hsci Pointer to a SCI_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
2576:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci.c ****   *                    the configuration information for the specified SCI module.
